          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get the worry out of your head and onto a ticket." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "머릿속 걱정을 꺼내 주차권에 옮겨 적어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give it your full attention. It's the only thing to do right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "지금은 이것만 온전히 들여다보세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사라짐"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heavy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "무거움"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "History" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이력"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it works" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사용 방법"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How loud is it now?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "지금은 얼마나 크게 울리나요?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How loud is it right now?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "지금 얼마나 크게 울리나요?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it drives back into your head, notice it and tell yourself: it has a spot. You'll deal with it at Worry Time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "다시 머릿속으로 들어오면 알아차리고 이렇게 말해 주세요. '이미 자리가 있어. 걱정 시간에 다룰 거야.'"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IN" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "입차"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It didn't happen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "일어나지 않았어요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It happened" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "일어났어요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stays hidden until your daily Worry Time. If it comes back, remind yourself it already has a spot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "매일 정한 걱정 시간까지 숨겨둬요. 다시 떠오르면 '이미 자리가 있어'라고 떠올려요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was %lld when you parked it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주차할 때는 %lld였어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's out of the lot. Drive away." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주차장을 떠났어요. 이제 보내주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's parked until tomorrow's Worry Time. When it pops up again in the shower, just tell yourself: it already has a spot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "내일 걱정 시간까지 주차해 뒀어요. 샤워하다 다시 떠오르면 '이미 자리가 있어'라고만 말해 주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's Worry Time. Give it %lld focused minutes, then decide what to do with it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정 시간이에요. %lld분만 집중해서 들여다보고 어떻게 할지 정해요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep it parked" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "계속 주차해 두기"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep parking. Patterns show up after a few exits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "계속 주차해 보세요. 몇 번 출차하면 패턴이 보여요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later" : {
